From: GDmio <zhalin66@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 23:59:40 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 02/14] BlueOS: ThemePicker: "Bright colors" switch in the
 palette sheet

A switch under "Dark theme" previews and applies the VIBRANT variant of the
chosen color (wallpaper colors and presets); off = TONAL_SPOT. It stays as set
when another color is picked; options with a style of their own (monochrome,
neutral, expressive) reset it and disable the switch. Without the updated color
picker flag, Apply now also applies the overriding style.

Change-Id: I558b641d42e614b701f334fde0dbba8793859dc8
